<!-- Heritage Story: Multirow Editorial Section Matching Live About Page -->
  <section id="about-us" class="km-section"
    style="background-color: var(--km-bg-secondary); border-top: var(--km-border-subtle); border-bottom: var(--km-border-subtle); padding: 96px 0;">
    <div class="km-container">
      
      <!-- Section Header -->
      <div class="km-section-header km-reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 64px;">
        <span class="km-eyebrow" style="color: var(--km-gold-primary); letter-spacing: 0.16em;">❖ OUR HERITAGE &amp; ARTISANAL LINEAGE ❖</span>
        <h2 class="km-heading-1" style="color: var(--km-text-primary); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.8vw, 3.2rem); margin: 8px 0 14px 0;">
          Lakshmi Engineering Works &rarr; KraftMart
        </h2>
        <p class="km-body-lead" style="color: var(--km-text-secondary); max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">
          Situated in the land of five rivers, Punjab — our journey began in 1996 with precision nickel and chrome electroplating, evolving into KraftMart on 1st November 2019 to bring authentic Sikh articles, wedding swords, and Indo-traditional handicrafts to patrons across the globe.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Story Row 1: Lakshmi Engineering Works (Image Left, Content Right) -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr; align-items: center; gap: 60px; margin-bottom: 80px;">
        <div style="position: relative;" class="km-reveal-left">
          <div style="border-radius: var(--km-radius-md); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.35); box-shadow: var(--km-shadow-medium); background: #14100D;">
            <img src="{{ 'live_about_lakshmi.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Lakshmi Engineering Works - Established 1996 in Punjab"
              loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="width: 100%; object-fit: cover; max-height: 480px; display: block; transition: transform 0.6s ease;" />
          </div>
          <div
            style="position: absolute; bottom: -20px; right: -20px; background-color: var(--km-bg-dark); color: var(--km-text-light); padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: var(--km-radius-md); border: var(--km-border-gold); max-width: 250px; text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);">
            <span
              style="font-family: var(--km-font-heading); font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--km-gold-light); display: block; line-height: 1;">1996</span>
            <span
              style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--km-text-muted-light);">Lakshmi Engineering Works · Punjab</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="km-reveal-right">
          <span class="km-eyebrow" style="color: var(--km-gold-dark);">SITUATE IN THE LAND OF FIVE RIVERS</span>
          <h3 class="km-heading-1" style="font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.1rem); margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--km-text-primary);">
            Our 1996 Roots: Electroplating, Polishing &amp; Blade Craft
          </h3>
          <p class="km-body-lead" style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--km-text-primary); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
            Situate in the land of five rivers, We, <strong>Lakshmi Engineering Works</strong>, began our journey in 1996 as a product + service based enterprise. The core of our service is <strong>Nickel and Chrome Electroplating and Polishing</strong>, making the goods ready to go for their use.
          </p>
          
          <div style="background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-family: var(--km-font-display); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--km-gold-dark); margin-bottom: 10px;">
              Main products started from &amp; currently doing for job work:
            </div>
            <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--km-text-primary);">
              <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span>❖</span> Machinery and Corrugation parts .</li>
              <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span>❖</span> Automated Stitching And Perforation machines.</li>
              <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span>❖</span> Hand-tool drilling machines</li>
              <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span>❖</span> Accessories of various vintage vehicles (silencer, handles, rims, etc.)</li>
              <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--km-crimson-primary);"><span>⚔️</span> Kirpan / Sword blades – MAJORLY OUR JOB WORK SERVICE.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <p style="color: var(--km-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 22px;">
            <strong>Our Own Line of Products:</strong> In addition to this, we also deal in Sikh Items used for Prakash purposes for Shri Guru Granth Sahib (Prakash Arrowhead / Teer, Prakash Chakar, Prakash Chawar). Backed by 20+ years of electroplating mastery and deep association with Sikhism, we embarked on a product-based startup on <strong>1st November, 2019</strong>. Through Etsy (<strong>KraftMartIN</strong> with 700+ U.S.A. clients), Instagram, eBay, and India Art, we proudly serve over <strong>3,000+ domestic and 1,900+ international clients</strong>.
          </p>

          <a href="/pages/about" class="km-btn km-btn-outline" style="padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 0.9rem;">Read The Complete History &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Story Row 2: KraftMart (Content Left, Image Right) -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 60px;">
        <div class="km-reveal-left">
          <span class="km-eyebrow" style="color: var(--km-gold-dark);">PROUD SUBSIDIARY OF LAKSHMI ENGINEERING WORKS</span>
          <h3 class="km-heading-1" style="font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.1rem); margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--km-text-primary);">
            A Venture Called KraftMart:<br>Your All-In-One Heritage Store
          </h3>
          <p class="km-body-lead" style="margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--km-text-primary); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
            As a proud subsidiary of Lakshmi Engineering Works, at KraftMart, we specialize in creating exquisite Indo-traditional handicrafts, Sikh Kakar articles, and bidding accessories, catering to a diverse clientele who appreciate authentic and culturally rich items.
          </p>

          <div style="background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.25); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="font-family: var(--km-font-display); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--km-gold-dark); margin-bottom: 10px;">
              Your All-In-One Store For:
            </div>
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 10px; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--km-text-primary);">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span>☬</span> Customized Sikh Articles &amp; Accessories</div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span>💍</span> Personalized Bidding Handicrafts</div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span>✍️</span> Custom Engraving Options</div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span>⚡</span> Punjabi Hand-Cuff Katas</div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span>🧵</span> Elegant Gold &amp; Silver Wire Work</div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span>🛡️</span> Miniatures Collectibles Pieces</div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; grid-column: span 2;"><span>🏡</span> Home Décor — Wall Hanging Products</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p style="color: var(--km-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 24px;">
            Our commitment to customer satisfaction is unwavering; we have a dedicated team that promptly addresses and resolves customer requests, ensuring a seamless and pleasant shopping experience. To further enhance our services, <strong>we maintain a FedEx account, facilitating swift and reliable delivery within 10 days</strong>, excluding processing time.
          </p>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <a href="/collections/all" class="km-btn km-btn-primary">Explore All Collections &rarr;</a>
            <a href="/pages/about" class="km-btn km-btn-outline" style="padding: 14px 22px;">View Our Full Story</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="position: relative;" class="km-reveal-right">
          <div style="border-radius: var(--km-radius-md); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.35); box-shadow: var(--km-shadow-medium); background: #14100D;">
            <img src="{{ 'live_about_kraftmart.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="KraftMart Exquisite Indo-Traditional Handicrafts and Wedding Swords"
              loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="width: 100%; object-fit: cover; max-height: 480px; display: block; transition: transform 0.6s ease;" />
          </div>
          <div
            style="position: absolute; bottom: -20px; left: -20px; background-color: var(--km-bg-dark); color: var(--km-text-light); padding: 18px 22px; border-radius: var(--km-radius-md); border: var(--km-border-gold); max-width: 240px; text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);">
            <span
              style="font-family: var(--km-font-heading); font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--km-gold-light); display: block; line-height: 1;">10 Days</span>
            <span
              style="font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--km-text-muted-light);">FedEx Worldwide Delivery</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


